r-output .wst-smallrefs ol.references{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .wst-smallrefs-ruled{border-top:1px solid;padding-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .wst-smallrefs ol.references.uksi{margin-top:0;list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .wst-smallrefs ol.references.uksi li::marker{font-weight:bold}</style>\n<div class=\"prp-pages-output\"><div class=\"reflist wst-smallrefs\" style=\"\">\n<ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Munis.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">More strictly Rhythm.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Gunas.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Prakriti.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-p205Gunas-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-p205Gunas_5-0\">5.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-p205Gunas_5-1\">5.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-p205Gunas_5-2\">5.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-p205Gunas_5-3\">5.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-p205Gunas_5-4\">5.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-p205Gunas_5-5\">5.5</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-p205Gunas_5-6\">5.6</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-p205Gunas_5-7\">5.7</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-p205Gunas_5-8\">5.8</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Gunas.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-6\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">The Amrita.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-7\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Dharma.</span>\n</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- 